# Project Goals

This project was built to demonstrate practical experience with:

- Django Backend Development
- Relational Data Modeling
- Authentication
- User / Profile Management
- Django Signals
- Django Forms
- Server-side Validation
- Filtering
- Image Uploads
- Email Integration
- Django Admin
- Environment-based Configuration
- Production Preparation

The goal was not simply to build a basic CRUD application, but to create a realistic marketplace-style application with interconnected users, profiles, listings, locations, filtering, likes, media, email communication, and administrative management.

